# The only image built from this repository is the repeater server's
# (`docker build -f repeater/server/Dockerfile .`). An allowlist, so the context never carries
# node_modules, every target/ or the app.
#
# Cargo loads every workspace member's manifest -- and the phone's path dependencies -- even for
# `-p trail-stash`, so the phone crates and the Windows host come along whole. They are a few MB
# of source and are never compiled here.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!third_party/
!repeater/protocol/
!repeater/server/Cargo.toml
!repeater/server/src/
!modules/iroh-location/rust/
!modules/iroh-location/rust-wasm/
!repeater/windows/host/Cargo.toml
!repeater/windows/host/src/
**/target/
